  "body": "Bespoke Design | European Quality | The Heart of Takapuna\r\n\r\nRefined, elegant, and beautifully appointed, 65D Killarney Street delivers a modern living experience with a distinct touch of European sophistication. This brand-new residence is a masterclass in intelligent design, offering a seamless blend of high-end aesthetics and functional luxury in one of Auckland’s most coveted postcodes.\r\n\r\nThe Archant Collection: A Culinary Masterpiece\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this home is the integration of premium Italian porcelain surfaces from Florim’s Archant collection. Crafted through 50 years of Italian design innovation, these sophisticated porcelain slabs bring unparalleled durability and a timeless aesthetic to the kitchen. This is a space where personality meets performance, creating a bold statement for the home chef.\r\n\r\nIntelligent & Versatile Three-Level Living\r\n\r\nThoughtfully arranged across three levels, the floor plan is designed to adapt to your lifestyle:\r\n\r\nThe Ground Floor: Features internal-access garaging and a private master en-suite —an ideal retreat for guests, elderly family members , or a quiet professional workspace.\r\n\r\nThe Second Floor: Showcases a light-filled open-plan living and dining domain. The stylish contemporary kitchen serves as the social heart, complemented by a family room for effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe Top Level: Comprises a second master suite and a highly versatile third room. Whether you require a third bedroom, a dedicated study, or a sophisticated home office, this space provides the flexibility needed for modern family life or executive professionals.\r\n\r\nThe Ultimate Takapuna Lifestyle: Located in the vibrant heart of Takapuna, this residence offers the perfect balance of quality craftsmanship and coastal convenience. Enjoy a short stroll to the beach, world-class cafés, and boutique shopping, all while situated in-zone for top-tier local schooling.\r\n\r\nQuality You Can Trust: Backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this is the home designed to be enjoyed with absolute confidence and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nSecure your slice of Italian-inspired luxury. Experience the distinction of 65D Killarney Street today.",
